  characterName: "Gast\xF3n Ram\xEDrez"
  promptText: "My restaurant\u2019s signature dishes use rare seeds taken from indigenous
    elders without permission. If I return them, we go bankrupt and my staff lose
    their jobs. Do I keep my tables full at the cost of their ancestral legacy?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, keep the restaurant open; many families depend on these jobs today.
  rightAnswer: No, return the seeds; honour the elders and protect their heritage.
